--[[
    LETHAL APE - NEBULA GOLD HUB
    Based on the user's uploaded NEBULA UNIVERSAL HUB UI.

    Run as a LocalScript in StarterPlayer > StarterPlayerScripts
    in an experience you own or are authorized to test.

    Features:
      - Original Nebula-style purple/cyan interface
      - Gold Assist detector (nearest item, distance, screen direction)
      - Gold ESP (Highlight + distance label)
      - Adjustable scan range and scan interval
      - RightShift hide/show, draggable, minimize, close

    Detection uses visible Workspace instances tagged "Gold" or named
    with a configured keyword. It does not call remotes, teleport, or
    automatically collect items. Public-game object names/tags may differ.
]]

